weather, computer). Concerns: communication tone, maybe cooperation.\n\nCandidate C: can make correct decisions quickly, difficulty communicating ideas, regarded as egocentric, not willing to further education, puts concern for others above everything, excellent attention skills. Strengths: decision quality, attention, concern for others (cooperation). Concerns: communication difficulty, egocentric, lack of development.\n\nCandidate D: responds to unexpected events adequately, can concentrate very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, considered moody, regarded as a loner. Strengths: adaptability, attention, problem solving, responsibility. Concerns: moodiness, loner (cooperation).\n\nWe need best overall fit. Likely Candidate B has strong reliability, stress, technical, but communication tone issue. Candidate C has decision quality and attention, but communication and egocentric. Candidate D has responsibility and problem solving but moody and loner. Candidate A has technical but unfriendly and health.\n\nProbably Candidate B is strongest overall: conscientious, stress handling, technical, though communication tone issue could be mitigated. So I will recommend Candidate B.\n\nMake contribution: I will state my recommendation for Candidate B, referencing strengths and concerns, and note that compared to others, B's strengths outweigh concerns.\n\nNo prior discussion, so just start.\n\nPUBLIC_MESSAGE: I will argue for B.\n\nMETADATA_JSON vote B."}
